&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/framework/wpf/advanced/wpf-architecture#systemwindowsmediavisual&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;WPF Architecture - docs.microsoft.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://social.msdn.microsoft.com/Forums/en-US/2ca9e3d5-06b9-4ca0-b5e0-0a42d54cd926/wpf-tooltip-rendering-issue-application-hang?forum=wpf&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;WPF ToolTip Rendering Issue : Application Hang - social.msdn.microsoft.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
